{
 "description": "Review outbox v3 (IndexedDB database 'qinqin-outbox', object store 'items', keyPath 'event.id'): one record per item {userId, queuedAt, event}, the same item as v2. settle(items, user, now) adopts unowned items for `user`, removes other users' items older than 30 days, and flushes only `user`'s items. Events keep their original ids and the unchanged review event format. `migration` holds the one-time move of the v2 localStorage array ('qinqin.study.pending.v2') into the store: items are put by event id (an id already in the store keeps the stored record), invalid entries are dropped, the key is removed. `order` holds the queue order. The pre-v2 queue ('qinqin.study.pending', v0.3.x) is no longer read (#198).",
 "expiryDays": 30,
